WEBVTT

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:01.348
We believe they're true,

00:04:01.372 --> 00:04:03.450
on the notion that
of course you can believe

00:04:03.474 --> 00:04:05.952
what your eyes and ears are telling you.

00:04:06.476 --> 00:04:08.175
And it's that mechanism

00:04:08.199 --> 00:04:11.897
that might undermine our shared
sense of reality.

00:04:11.921 --> 00:04:15.068
Although we believe deepfakes
to be true, they're not.

00:04:15.604 --> 00:04:19.761
And we're attracted
to the salacious, the provocative.

00:04:20.365 --> 00:04:23.412
We tend to believe
and to share information

00:04:23.436 --> 00:04:25.459
that's negative and novel.

00:04:25.809 --> 00:04:30.828
And researchers have found that online
hoaxes spread 10 times faster